<title>USA: California $250 mln agency bonds not repriced.</title>
<headline>California $250 mln agency bonds not repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday the account is closed on Public Facilities Financing Authority, Calif.'s $250 million bond deal, and there was no</p>
<p>repricing.</p>
<p>PUBLIC FACILITIES FINANCING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>OF THE CITY OF SAN DIEGO</p>
<p>RE: $250,000,000*</p>
<p>SEWER REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997 A AND B</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THERE ARE NO COUPON OR PRICE CHANGES ON THIS ISSUE.</p>
<p>NO MORE ORDERS WILL BE ACCEPTED.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED</p>
